window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>This is a story about an unwanted mate and a werewolf who'd rather be something else.</b></p> <p>Samantha has patiently waited for her mate ever since her first shift. After finding him, she discovers that he has a pregnant human fiancée he's been with for the last four years. Now Samantha needs to make some difficult decisions about the rest of her life. She must also unlearn all that she's been taught about mates, life, and herself, in order to survive and move on.</p>"; 
